  <Sequence DisplayName="DispatcherAudio: 새 음성 파일을 서버에 등록하고 큐에 넣기" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="주기적으로 실행되어, inbox의 새 음성 파일을 서버에 등록(R-04)하고 Orchestrator 큐에 넣은 뒤 QUEUED를 보고(R-05)한다. 중복(409)은 기존 건의 상태에 따라 분기한다."><Sequence.Variables><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="baseDir" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="inFolder" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="procFolder" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="doneFolder" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="failedFolder" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="queueName" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="baseUrl" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="apiKey" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" Name="cntQueued" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" Name="cntSkipped" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" Name="cntFailed" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="httpMethod" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="apiPath" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="bodyJson" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" Name="httpStatus" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="respBody" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="netError" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Boolean" Name="proceed" /></Sequence.Variables><Sequence DisplayName="1. 준비"><Assign DisplayName="프로젝트 폴더 경로"><Assign.To><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String">[baseDir]</OutArgument></Assign.To><Assign.Value><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String">[If(String.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(&quot;CALLCENTER_BASE&quot;)), System.IO.Directory.GetCurrentDirectory(), Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(&quot;CALLCENTER_BASE&quot;))]</InArgument></Assign.Value></Assign><Assign DisplayName="감지 폴더(inbox)" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="개발·테스트용 로컬 폴더. 운영에서는 Google Drive inbox로 바꾼다."><Assign.To><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String">[inFolder]</OutArgument></Assign.To><Assign.Value><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String">[baseDir &amp; &quot;\Runtime\inbox&quot;]</In